        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man to whom the LORD imputeth not iniquity, and in whose spirit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no guile.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I kept silence, my bones became old through my roaring all the day long.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For day and night thy hand was heavy upon me: my moisture is turned into the drouth of summer. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I acknowledged my sin to thee, and my iniquity have I not hid. I said, I will confess my transgressions to the LORD; and thou forgavest the iniquity of my sin. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this shall every one that is godly pray to thee in a time when thou mayest be found: surely in the floods of great waters they shall not come nigh to him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my hiding place; thou wilt preserve me from trouble; thou wilt compass me about with songs of deliverance. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will instruct thee, and teach thee in the way which thou shalt go: I will guide thee with my eye.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be ye not as the horse, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the mule, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " have no understanding: whose mouth must be held in with bit and bridle, lest they come near to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many sorrows ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the wicked: but he that trusteth in the LORD, mercy shall encompass him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.32.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.32.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be glad in the LORD, and rejoice, ye righteous: and shout for joy, all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ye that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upright in heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
